{"id":"n5-131","title":"まだ～ません (mada ~masen)","jlptLevel":5,"shortExplanation":"Expresses that something has not happened or been done yet (polite form).","longExplanation":"The まだ～ません grammar point is used to express that something has not happened or been done yet in a polite register. It is used with the negative ます-form of a verb (～ません). まだ is placed before the verb phrase.","formation":"まだ + Verb-ます form (negative)","examples":[{"jp":"昼ご飯をまだ食べていません。","romaji":"Hirugohan o mada tabete imasen.","en":"I have not eaten lunch yet.","words":[{"surface":"昼","vocabId":"1426250","reading":"ひる"},{"surface":"ご飯","vocabId":"1270590","reading":"ごはん"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"まだ","vocabId":"1527110","reading":"まだ"},{"surface":"食べ","vocabId":"1358280","reading":"たべる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い"},{"surface":"ませ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"宿題がまだ終わっていません。","romaji":"Shukudai ga mada owatte imasen.","en":"I have not finished my homework yet.","words":[{"surface":"宿題","vocabId":"1337270","reading":"しゅくだい"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"まだ","vocabId":"1527110","reading":"まだ"},{"surface":"終わっ","vocabId":"1589600","reading":"おわる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い"},{"surface":"ませ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"東京にはまだ行ったことがありません。","romaji":"Toukyou ni wa mada itta koto ga arimasen.","en":"I have not been to Tokyo yet.","words":[{"surface":"東京","vocabId":"1447690","reading":"とうきょう"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"まだ","vocabId":"1527110","reading":"まだ"},{"surface":"行っ","vocabId":"1589060","reading":"おこなう"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"あり","vocabId":"1225940","reading":"あり"},{"surface":"ませ","vocabId":null},{